#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:2
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>You can locate objects in the sky by their name.\n"
#| "\t\t\tUse Ctrl+F, the \"Focus->Find Object\" menu item, or the \"Find\"\n"
#| "\t\t\tToolbar button.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can locate objects in the sky by their name.\n"
"\t\t\tUse Ctrl+F, the \"Pointing->Find Object\" menu item, or the \"Find "
"Object\"\n"
"\t\t\tToolbar button.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ आकाशमा वस्तु तिनीहरूको नामद्वारा तोक्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t\tCtrl+F, \"फोकस->वस्तु फेला पार्ने\" मेनु वस्तु, वा \"फेला पार्ने\"\n"
"\t\t\tउपकरणपट्टी बटन प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:10
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>To change your Geographic Location,\n"
#| "\t\t\tuse Ctrl+G, the \"Settings->Set Geographic Location...\" menu "
#| "item,\n"
#| "\t\t\tor the \"globe\" Toolbar button.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>To change your Geographic Location,\n"
"\t\t\tuse Ctrl+G, the \"Settings->Geographic...\" menu item,\n"
"\t\t\tor the \"globe\" Toolbar button.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँको भौगोलिक स्थान परिवर्तन गर्न,\n"
"\t\t\tCtrl+G, \"सेटिङ->भौगोलिक स्थान सेट गर्नुहोस्...\" मेनु वस्तु,\n"
"\t\t\tवा \"ग्लोब\" उपकरणपट्टी बटन प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:18
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>You can Track an object, so it will always be centered\n"
#| "\t\t\tin the display.<br/>\n"
#| "\t\t\tUse Ctrl+T, the \"Focus->Track Object\" menu item, or the \"lock\"\n"
#| "\t\t\tToolbar button. You can also simply center the object by\n"
#| "\t\t\tdouble-clicking on it or selecting \"Center and Track\" from the\n"
#| "\t\t\tobject's popup menu.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can Track an object, so it will always be centered\n"
"\t\t\tin the display.<br/>\n"
"\t\t\tUse Ctrl+T, the \"Pointing->Engage Tracking\" menu item, or the \"lock"
"\"\n"
"\t\t\tToolbar button. You can also simply center the object by\n"
"\t\t\tdouble-clicking on it or selecting \"Center and Track\" from the\n"
"\t\t\tobject's popup menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ एउटा वस्तु ट्रयाक गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ, जसले गर्दा यो सधै प्रदर्शनमा \n"
"\t\t\tकेन्द्रिकृत हुनेछ ।<br/>\n"
"\t\t\tCtrl+T, \"फोकस->ट्रयाक वस्तु\" मेनु वस्तु, वा \"ताल्चा\"\n"
"\t\t\tउपकरणपट्टी बटन प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् । तपाईँ पनि यसलाई साधारण रूपमा डबल क्लिक गरेर "
"वस्तु\n"
"\t\t\tकेन्द्रिकृत गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ वा वस्तुको पपअप मेनुबाट \"केन्द्र र ट्रयाक \" चयन गरेर\n"
"\t\t\tगर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:29
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The KStars Handbook includes the AstroInfo Project, a series\n"
"\t\t\tof informative articles about Astronomy.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>केडीई तारा हातेपुस्तिकाले एस्ट्रोइन्फो परियोजना समावेश गर्दछ, खगोलशास्त्रको "
"बारेमा\n"
"\t\t\tसूचनात्मक लेखको श्रेणी ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:36
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>There are three on-screen \"Info Boxes\" which show data related to "
"the\n"
"\t\t\ttime/date, your geographic location, and the current central position "
"on the\n"
"\t\t\tsky (the focus).  You can drag these boxes with the mouse, and \"shade"
"\" them\n"
"\t\t\tby double-clicking them to show more (or less) information.  You can "
"hide\n"
"\t\t\tthem altogether in the Settings->Info Boxes menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>त्यहाँ तीन पर्दा-भित्र \"सूचना बाकस\" छन् जसले समय/मिति, तपाईँको भौगोलिक "
"स्थान, र आकाश (फोकस) मा हालको केन्द्रिय स्थिति\n"
"\t\t\tसँग सम्बन्धित डेटा\n"
"\t\t\tदेखाउँदछ ।  तपाईँ यी बाकसहरू माउसद्वारा तान्न सक्नुहुन्छ, र धेरै (वा थोरै) सूचना "
"देखाउँन तिनीहरूलाई डबल क्लिक गरेर\n"
"\t\t\t\"छायाँ\" लगाउन सकिन्छ ।  तपाईँ तिनीहरूलाई एकै ठाउँ सेटिङ->सूचना बाकस मेनुमा\n"
"\t\t\tलुकाउँनु सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:46
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>KStars has a full-screen mode; you can toggle this mode using the\n"
"\t\t\t\"fullscreen\" toolbar button, or by pressing Ctrl+Shift+F.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>केडीई तारासँग पूरा-पर्दा मोड छ; तपाईँ यो मोडलाई \"पूरा पर्दा\" उपकरणपट्टी बटन "
"प्रयोग गरेर, वा Ctrl+Shift+F थिचेर\n"
"\t\t\t\"टगल गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:53
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The N,S,E,W keys will point the display at the North,\n"
"\t\t\tSouth, East and West points on the Horizon.  The Z key will point the\n"
"\t\t\tdisplay at the Zenith.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>N,S,E,W कुञ्जीले क्षितिजमा उत्तर, दक्षिण, पूर्व र पश्चिम बिन्दु\n"
"\t\t\tमा प्रदर्शन इङ्गित गर्नेछ ।  Z कुञ्जीले जेनिथमा प्रदर्शन\n"
"\t\t\tइङ्गित गर्नेछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:61
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The 0-9 keys will center the display on one of the major solar "
"system\n"
"\t\t\tbodies.  0 centers on the Sun, 3 centers on the Moon; the rest are the "
"eight\n"
"\t\t\tplanets, in order of their distance from the Sun.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>०-९ कुञ्जीले एउटा मुख्य सौरमण्डल भागको प्रदर्शनमा\n"
"\t\t\tकेन्द्रित गर्नेछ ।  ० ले घामलाई केन्द्रित गर्दछ, ३ ले चन्द्रमामा केन्द्रित गर्दछ, बाँकी "
"घामबाट तिनीहरूको दूरी क्रममा\n"
"\t\t\tआठ ग्रहहरू हुन् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:69
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>Click and Drag with the mouse to slew the skymap to a new position "
"on\n"
"\t\t\tthe sky.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>आकाशमा नयाँ स्थितिमा आकाशे नक्सा हटाउन माउसद्वारा\n"
"\t\t\tक्लिक गर्नुहोस् र तान्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:76
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>Double-click with the mouse to center the display on the location\n"
"\t\t\tof the mouse cursor.  If you double-click on an object, KStars will\n"
"\t\t\tautomatically begin tracking it.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>माउस कर्सरको स्थानमा प्रदर्शन केन्द्रित गर्न माउससँग \n"
"\t\t\tडबल क्लिक गर्नुहोस् ।  यदि तपाईँले एउटा वस्तुमा डबल क्लिक गर्नुभयो भने, केडीई ताराले "
"यसलाई\n"
"\t\t\tस्वचालित रूपमा ट्रयाकिङ गर्न सुरु गर्दछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:84
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The status bar displays the current sky coordinates of the mouse "
"cursor,\n"
"\t\t\tin both Equatorial and Horizontal coordinate systems.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>वस्तुस्थितिपट्टीले दुवै भुमध्यवर्ती र तेर्सो समकक्ष प्रणालीमा माउस कर्सरको हालको "
"आकाशे समकक्ष,\n"
"\t\t\tप्रदर्शन गर्दछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:91
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The display can be zoomed in or out by spinning your mouse's scroll "
"wheel,\n"
"\t\t\tor by dragging the mouse up or down with the middle mouse button "
"pressed.  You\n"
"\t\t\tcan also use the +/- keys, or the \"Zoom In\"/\"Zoom Out\" items in "
"the toolbar and\n"
"\t\t\tin the View menu.  The Zoom Level can be set manually using the \"Zoom "
"to Angular\n"
"\t\t\tSize\" item in the View menu (Shift+Ctrl+Z), and you can set it "
"graphically by\n"
"\t\t\tholding down the Ctrl button while dragging the mouse to define a "
"rectangle for\n"
"\t\t\tthe new window boundaries.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँको माउसको स्क्रोल ह्वील घुमाएर वा थिचिएको बीचको माउस बटनसँग माथि तल "
"माउस तानेर,\n"
"\t\t\tप्रदर्शनको जुम बढाउन वा घटाउन सकिन्छ ।  तपाईँ\n"
"\t\t\tउपकरणपट्टी र दृश्य मेनुमा +/- कुञ्जी, वा \"जुम बढाउनुहोस्\"/\"जुम घटाउनुहोस्\" वस्तु\n"
"\t\t\tपनि प्रयोग गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  जुम स्तर दृश्य मेनु (Shift+Ctrl+Z)मा \"कोणिय साइजमा "
"जुम गर्ने\" वस्तु प्रयोग गरेर म्यानुअल तरिकाले\n"
"\t\t\tसेट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ, र तपाईँ यसलाई नयाँ सञ्झ्याल सीमाका लागि आयात परिभाषित गर्न\n"
"\t\t\tमाउस तान्दा Ctrl बटन समातेर\n"
"\t\t\tग्राफिकल्ली सेट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:103
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>You can manually set the coordinates of the central Focus point.\n"
#| "\t\t\tPress Ctrl+M, or use the \"Focus->Set Focus Manually...\" menu "
#| "item, and enter\n"
#| "\t\t\tthe desired coordinates in the popup window.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can manually set the coordinates of the central Focus point.\n"
"\t\t\tPress Ctrl+M, or use the \"Pointing->Set Coordinates Manually...\" "
"menu item, and enter\n"
"\t\t\tthe desired coordinates in the popup window.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ म्यानुअल तरिकाले रूपमा केन्द्रिय फोकस बिन्दुको समकक्ष सेट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t\tCtrl+M थिच्नुहोस्, वा \"फोकस->म्यानुअल तरिकाले फोकस सेट गर्नुहोस्...\" मेनु वस्तु "
"प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्, र पपअप सञ्झ्यालमा इच्छयाएको समकक्ष\n"
"\t\t\tप्रविष्ट गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:111
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>To switch between Equatorial and Horizontal coordinate\n"
"\t\t\tsystems, use the \"View->Coordinates\" menu item, or press the "
"spacebar.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>भूमध्यवर्ती र तेर्सो समकक्ष प्रणाली बीच स्विच\n"
"\t\t\tगर्न, \"दृश्य->समकक्ष\" मेनु वस्तु प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्, वा खाली स्थानपट्टी थिच्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:118
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>To set the Time and Date, type Ctrl+S, use the \"Time->Set Time\" "
"menu item,\n"
"\t\t\tor press the \"time\" toolbar button.  Note that dates in KStars can "
"be very\n"
"\t\t\tremote; you can use any year between -50,000 and +50,000.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>समय र मिति सेट गर्न, Ctrl+S टाइप गर्नुहोस्, \"समय->समय सेट गर्नुहोस्\" प्रयोग "
"गर्नुहोस्,\n"
"\t\t\tवा \"समय\" उपकरणपट्टी बटन थिच्नुहोस् ।  याद गर्नुहोस् कि केडीई तारा धेरै टाढा\n"
"\t\t\tहुन सक्छ; तपाईँ -५०,००० र +५०,००० बीच कुनै वर्ष प्रयोग गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:126
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can use Ctrl+E or the \"Time->Set Time to Now\" menu item to "
"synchronize\n"
"\t\t\tthe simulation clock with your CPU clock.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ आफ्नो सीपीयू घडीसँग नक्कली घडी समक्रमन गर्न\n"
"\t\t\tCtrl+E वा \"समय->अहिले समय सेट गर्नुहोस्\" मेनु वस्तु प्रयोग गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:133
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Spin Box in the Toolbar allows you to adjust the time step\n"
"\t\t\tused by the KStars clock; setting it to \"1.0 sec\" provides \"real "
"time\".\n"
"\t\t\tNote: negative values make time run backwards.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>उपकरणपट्टीमा स्पिन बाकसले केडीई तारा घडीले प्रयोग गरेको समय रण समायोजन गर्न\n"
"\t\t\tअनुमति दिन्छ; यसलाई \"१.० सेकेन्ड\" मा सेटिङ गर्नाले \"वास्तविक समय\" उपलब्ध हुन्छ "
"।\n"
"\t\t\tद्रष्टब्य: ऋणात्मक मानले समयलाई पछितिर धकेल्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:141
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>You can stop and start the clock with the \"Play/Pause\" button\n"
#| "\t\t\tin the Toolbar, or with the \"Time->Stop/Start Clock\" menu item.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can stop and start the clock with the \"Play/Pause\" button\n"
"\t\t\tin the Toolbar, or with the \"Time->Stop Clock\" menu item.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ उपकरणपट्टीमा \"प्ले/पज\"\n"
"\t\t\tबटनद्वारा, वा \"समय->घडी रोक्नुहोस्/सुरु गर्नुहोस्\" मेनु वस्तुसँग घडी रोक्न र सुरु गर्न "
"सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:148
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can advance the simulation clock forward or backward by a single\n"
"\t\t\ttime step by pressing the \"&gt;\" or \"&lt;\" keys.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ \"&gt;\" वा \"&lt;\" कुञ्जी थिचेर एकल समय चरणद्वारा अगाडि र पछाडि\n"
"\t\t\tनक्कली घडी उन्नत गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:155
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>When you click your mouse in the map, the object in the sky nearest\n"
"\t\t\tthe mouse cursor is identified in the status bar.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँले नक्सामा माउस क्लिक गर्दा, माउस कर्सर नजिकको आकाशे वस्तु\n"
"\t\t\tवस्तुस्थितिपट्टीमा परिभाषित हुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:162
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>When you hold the mouse cursor still for a moment, the nearest "
"object\n"
"\t\t\twill be identified by a temporary name label that automatically fades\n"
"\t\t\tout when you move the mouse again.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँले त्यो क्षणसम्मका लागि माउस कर्सर समात्दा, सबभन्दा नजिकको वस्तु\n"
"\t\t\tअस्थायी नाम लेबुलद्वारा परिभाषित हुनेछ जुन तपाईँले फेरि माउस सार्दा\n"
"\t\t\tस्वचालित रूपमा हराउँछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:170
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>Right-click with the mouse to open a popup menu of detailed options\n"
"\t\t\tfor a particular object, including links to images and information on\n"
"\t\t\tthe Internet.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>इन्टरनेटमा सूचना र छविमा लिङ्क समावेश गरेर, निश्चित वस्तुका लागि\n"
"\t\t\tविस्तृत गरिएको विकल्पको पपअप मेनु खोल्न\n"
"\t\t\tमाउससँग दायाँ-क्लिक गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:178
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The deep-sky objects with a special color (the default is Red)\n"
"\t\t\thave extra URL links available in their popup menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>विशेष रङ (पूर्वानिर्धारित रातो) भएको गाढा-आकाशे वस्तुसँग\n"
"\t\t\tतिनीहरूको पपअप मेनुमा अतिरिक्त यूआरएल लिङ्क उपलब्ध छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:185
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>By default, stars in KStars are displayed with realistic colors.\n"
"\t\t\tA star's color depends on its temperature; cooler stars are red,\n"
"\t\t\twhile hotter stars are blue.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>पूर्वानिर्धारण अनुसार, केडीई तारामा ताराहरू वास्तविक रङमा प्रदर्शन हुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t\tएउटा ताराको रङ यसको तापक्रममा भ् पर्दछreचिसो ताराहरू रातो हुन्छन्,\n"
"\t\tभने तातो ताराहरू नीला हुन्छन् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:193
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>If you want the very latest orbital information for asteroids and\n"
#| "\t\t\tcomets (including recently-discovered objects), check the "
#| "\"Download\n"
#| "\t\t\tData\" tool (\"File|Download Data\" or Ctrl+D) frequently for "
#| "updated\n"
#| "\t\t\tephemerides.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>If you want the very latest orbital information for asteroids and\n"
"\t\t\tcomets (including recently-discovered objects), check the \"Download\n"
"\t\t\tData\" tool (\"File->Download New Data\" or Ctrl+D) frequently for "
"updated\n"
"\t\t\tephemerides.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>यदि तपाईँ (हालै पत्ता लगाइएको वस्तु समावेश गरेर) ग्रहिका र पुच्छ्रेताराका लागि\n"
"\t\t\tधेरै पछिल्लो अक्षिय सूचना चाहनुहुन्छ भने, अद्यावधिक भएको इफेमेरिड्सका लागि\n"
"\t\t\t\"डेटा डाउनलोड\" उपकरण (\"File|Download Data\" वा Ctrl+D) बारम्बार\n"
"\t\t\t जाँच गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:202
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>The Details window provides a large amount of information on any \n"
#| "\t\t\tobject in the sky, including coordinates, rise/set times, "
#| "internet \n"
#| "\t\t\tlinks, and your own custom notes.  Access the Details window "
#| "through \n"
#| "\t\t\tthe popup menu, or by clicking on an object and then pressing \"D"
#| "\".\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Details window provides a large amount of information on any \n"
"\t\t\tobject in the sky, including coordinates, rise/set times, Internet \n"
"\t\t\tlinks, and your own custom notes.  Access the Details window through \n"
"\t\t\tthe popup menu, or by clicking on an object and then pressing \"D\".\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>विस्तृत सञ्झ्यालले ठूलो सङ्ख्यामा सूचना आकाशमा कुनै वस्तुको बारेमा सूचना\n"
"\t\t\tउपलब्ध गराउँदछ, जसमा समकक्ष, उदाउने/अस्ताउने समय, इन्टरनेट \n"
"\t\t\tलिङ्क, र तपाईँको आफ्नो अनुकूल द्रष्टब्य समावेश हुन्छ ।  पपअप मेनु\n"
"\t\t\tमार्फत, वा एउटा वस्तुलाई क्लिक गरेर र \"D\" लाई थिचेर विस्तृत सञ्झ्याल पहुँच गर्न "
"सकिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:211
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can attach a name label to any object in the sky.  Toggle the \n"
"\t\t\tlabel in the popup menu, or by clicking on the object and then \n"
"\t\t\tpressing \"L\".\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ आकाशमा कुनै वस्तुमा नाम लेबुल संलग्न गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  पपअप \n"
"\t\t\tमेनुमा, वा वस्तुमा क्लिक गरेर र\n"
"\t\t\t \"L\" थिचेर लेबुल टगल गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:219
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The KStars Astrocalculator (Ctrl+C) gives you direct access to many \n"
"\t\t\tof the calculations that KStars does behind-the-scenes.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>केडीई ताराको एस्ट्रो गणकयन्त्र (Ctrl+C) ले धेरैजसो गणनामा\n"
"\t\t\tसीधै पहुँच दिन्छ जहाँ केडीई तारा दृश्य पछाडि हुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:226
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The AAVSO Light Curve Generator tool (Ctrl+V) connects to a server at "
"the\n"
"\t\t\tAmerican Association of Variable Star Observers, and constructs a\n"
"\t\t\tlightcurve for any of the 6000+ variable stars that they monitor\n"
"\t\t\ton a daily basis.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>AAVSO प्रकाश बक्र सर्जक उपकरण (Ctrl+V) ले चल तारा अन्वेषकको अमेरिकी संघमा "
"सर्भरमा\n"
"\t\t\tजडान गर्दछ, र कुनै पनि ६०००+ चल ताराका लागि\n"
"\t\t\tप्रकाश बक्र निर्माण गर्दछ जुन तिनीहरू\n"
"\t\t\tदैनिक आधारमा अनुगमन गर्दछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:235
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Altitude vs. Time tool (Ctrl+A) will plot altitude curves for any "
"group\n"
"\t\t\tof objects that you select.  This is a great tool for planning\n"
"\t\t\tobserving sessions.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>उन्नतांश विपरीत समय उपकरण (Ctrl+A) ले तपाईँले चयन गर्नुभएकोवस्तुको कुनै समूहका "
"लागि\n"
"\t\t\tउन्नतांश बक्र बनाउनेछ ।  यो अन्वेषण सत्र योजनाका लागि\n"
"\t\t\tमहान उपकरण हो ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:243
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>With the What's Up Tonight? tool (Ctrl+U), you can tell at a glance "
"what\n"
"\t\t\tobjects will be visible from your location on a given night.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>आज राती के छ? उपरकरणसँग, तपाईँ हेराइमा\n"
"\t\t\tदिएको रातमा तपाईँको स्थानबाट के वस्तु दृश्यात्मक हुनेछ भन्ने कुरा भन्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:250
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Observing List tool (Ctrl+L) gives you easy access to a selected "
"group \n"
"\t\t\tof objects.  Add objects to the list through the popup menu, or by\n"
"\t\t\tclicking on the object, and pressing \"O\".\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>अवलोकन सूची उपकरण (Ctrl+L) ले वस्तुको चयन गरेको समूहमा सजिलै\n"
"\t\t\tपहुँच गर्न दिन्छ ।  पपअप मेनु\n"
"मार्फत, वा वस्तुमा\n"
"\t\t\tक्लिक गरेर, \"O\" थिचेर सूचिबद्ध गर्न वस्तु थप्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:258
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>The ScriptBuilder tool allows you to construct complex DCOP\n"
#| "\t\t\tscripts using a simple GUI.  The scripts can be played back later\n"
#| "\t\t\tfrom the command line, or from within KStars.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The ScriptBuilder tool allows you to construct complex D-Bus\n"
"\t\t\tscripts using a simple GUI.  The scripts can be played back later\n"
"\t\t\tfrom the command line, or from within KStars.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>स्क्रिप्ट निर्माणकर्ता उपकरणले तपाईँलाई साधरण जीयूआई प्रयोग गरेर जटिल डीसीओपी "
"स्क्रिप्ट निर्माण गर्न\n"
"\t\t\tअनुमति दिन्छ ।  स्क्रिप्ट पछि आदेश रेखाबाट, वा केडीई तारा भित्रबाट\n"
"\t\t\tखेलाउन सकिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:266
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Solar System Viewer tool (Ctrl+Y) shows an overhead view of the "
"solar\n"
"\t\t\tsystem, showing the positions of the major planets for the current\n"
"\t\t\tsimulation date.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>सौरमण्डल दर्शक उपकरण (Ctrl+Y) ले हालको नक्कली मितिका लागि मुख्य ग्रहको स्थिति "
"देखाएर, सौरमण्डलको\n"
"\t\t\t एउटा, \n"
"\t\t\tसंलग्न दृश्य देखाउँछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:274
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Jupiter Moons tool (Ctrl+J) shows the relative positions of "
"Jupiter's\n"
"\t\t\tfour largest moons (Io, Europa, Ganymede and Callisto), as seen from\n"
"\t\t\tEarth, and as a function of time.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>बृहस्पतिको चन्द्रमा उपकरण (Ctrl+J) ले पृथ्वीबाट देखिएको रूपमा, र\n"
"\t\t\t समयको प्रकार्यको रूपमा बृहस्पतिको चौथो ठूलो, चन्द्रमा (लो, युरोपा, ग्यानीमेड र "
"कलिस्टो) को\n"
"\t\t\tसापेक्षिक स्थिति देखाउँछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:282
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can export the sky image to a file using the \"Save Sky Image\"\n"
"\t\t\titem in the File menu, or by pressing Ctrl+I.  In addition, you can\n"
"\t\t\trun KStars from a command prompt with the \"--dump\" argument to save "
"a\n"
"\t\t\tsky image to disk without even opening the program window.  This can\n"
"\t\t\tbe used to generate dynamic wallpaper for your KDE desktop.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ आकाशे छवि फाइल मेनुमा \"आकाशे छवि बचत गर्नुहोस्\" वस्तु प्रयोग गरेर, वा Ctrl"
"+l थिचेर\n"
"\t\t\tफाइलमा निर्गात गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  थपमा, तपाईँ कुनै\n"
"\t\t\tकार्यक्रम सञ्झ्याल खोली डिस्कमा आकाशे छवि बचत गर्न \"--dump\" तर्कसँग आदेश "
"प्रबर्द्धनबाट a\n"
"\t\t\tकेडीई तारा चलाउन सक्नुहुन्छ ।  यो तपाईँको\n"
"\t\t\tकेडीई डेस्कटपका लागि गतिशील वालपेपर सिर्जना गर्न प्रयोग गर्न सकिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:292
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>To add your own custom Object Catalogs, select\n"
#| "\t\t\t\"Add Catalog\" from the Catalogs tab in the KStars Configuration "
#| "window.\n"
#| "\t\t\tSee the Handbook for instructions on formatting your catalog file.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>To add your own custom Object Catalogs, select \"Import Catalog\" "
"or \n"
"\t\t\t\"Load Catalog\" from the Catalogs tab in the KStars Configuration "
"window.\n"
"\t\t\tSee the Handbook for instructions on formatting your catalog file.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँको आफ्नो अनुकूल वस्तु विवरणिका थप्न, केडीई तारा कन्फिगरेसन सञ्झ्यालमा\n"
"\t\t\t विवरणिकाबाट \"विवरणिका थप्नुहोस्\" चयन गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t\tतपाईँको विवरणिका फाइल ढाँचामा प्रशिक्षणका लागि हातेपुस्तिका हेर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:300
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>To add your own custom image/information URLs to\n"
"\t\t\tany object, select \"Add Link...\" from the object's popup menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>कुनै वस्तुमा तपाईँको आफ्नो अनुकूल छवि/सूचना यूआरएल\n"
"\t\t\tथप्न, वस्तुको पपअप मेनुबाट \"लिङ्क थप्नुहोस्...\" चयन गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:307
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can adjust dozens of display options by clicking the\n"
"\t\t\t\"configure\" Toolbar button, or selecting the \"Settings->Configure "
"KStars...\"\n"
"\t\t\tmenu item.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ \"कन्फिगर\" बटन क्लिक गरेर, वा \"सेटिङ->कन्फिगर केडीई तारा...\" मेनु "
"वस्तु\n"
"\t\t\tचयन गरेर प्रदर्शन विकल्पको दर्जन\n"
"\t\t\tसमायोजन गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:315
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The on-screen Info Boxes can be hidden or shown using the\n"
"\t\t\t\"Settings->Info Boxes\" menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>पर्दा भित्रका सूचना बाकसहरू \"सेटिङ->सूचना बाकस\" प्रयोग गरेर लुकाउन वा देखाउन\n"
"\t\t\t सकिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:322
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Toolbars can be hidden or shown using the \"Settings->Toolbars\" "
"menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>उपकरणपट्टी \"सेटिङ->उपकरणपट्टी\" मेनु प्रयोग गरेर लुकाउन वा देखाउन\n"
"\t\t सकिन्छ ।</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:328
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>You can hide either the Ra/Dec or Az/Alt coordinate fields in the "
#| "statusbar,\n"
#| "\t\t\tor hide the stausbar completely, using the Settings|Statusbar "
#| "menu.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can hide either the Ra/Dec or Az/Alt coordinate fields in the "
"statusbar,\n"
"\t\t\tor hide the statusbar completely, using the Settings->Statusbar menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ वस्तुस्थितिपट्टीमा या त Ra/Dec वा Az/Alt समकक्ष फिल्ड लुकाउन सक्नुहुन्छ,\n"
"\t\t\tवा सेटिङ|वस्तुस्थिति मेनु प्रयोग गरेर, पूर्ण रूपमा वस्तुस्थितिपट्टी लुकाउन सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:335
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can easily switch between predefined color schemes by selecting\n"
"\t\t\tthe scheme from the \"Settings->Color Schemes\" menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ \"सेटिङ->रङ योजना\" मेनुबाट योजना चयन गरेर पूर्वपरिभाषित रङ बीच सजिलै "
"स्वीच\n"
"\t\t\tगर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:342
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>You can define your own Geographic Locations.  Fill in the\n"
#| "\t\t\trequired fields in the \"Change Location\" Dialog and then press "
#| "the\n"
#| "\t\t\t\"Add to List\" button. Your Locations will be available in all\n"
#| "\t\t\tfuture sessions.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can define your own Geographic Locations.  Fill in the\n"
"\t\t\trequired fields in the \"Set Geographic Location\" Dialog and then "
"press the\n"
"\t\t\t\"Add City to List\" button. Your Locations will be available in all\n"
"\t\t\tfuture sessions.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ आफ्नो भौगोलिक स्थान परिभाषा गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  \"स्थान परिवर्तन गर्नुहोस्\" "
"संवादमा\n"
"\t\t\tआवश्यक फिल्ड भर्नुहोस् र त्यसपछि \"सूचीमा थप्नुहोस्\" बटन\n"
"\t\t\tथिच्नुहोस् । तपाईँको स्थान सबै भावी सत्रमा उपलब्ध\n"
"\t\t\tहुनेछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:351
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can define your own Color Schemes.  Adjust the colors\n"
"\t\t\tin the Configuration Window's \"Colors\" Tab, and then press the "
"\"Save\n"
"\t\t\tCurrent Colors\" button. Your Color Scheme will appear in the list in\n"
"\t\t\tall future sessions.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ आफ्नो रङ योजना परिभाषित गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  कन्फिगरेसन सञ्झ्यालको \"रङ\" "
"ट्याबमा रङ\n"
"\t\t\tसमायोजन गर्नुहोस्, र त्यसपछि \"हालको रङ बचत गर्नुहोस्\" बटन\n"
"\t\t\t थिच्नुहोस् । तपाईँको रङ योजना सबै भावी सत्रमा सूचीभित्र\n"
"\t\t\tदेखापर्नेछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:360
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\t\t<p>You can construct your own field-of-view (FOV) symbols, using the\n"
#| "\t\t\tFOV Editor under the Tools menu.  You can set the angular size, "
#| "the\n"
#| "\t\t\tshape, and the color of your new symbols.\n"
#| "\t\t</p>\n"
#| "\t\n"
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>You can construct your own field-of-view (FOV) symbols, using the\n"
"\t\t\tFOV Editor from the Settings->FOV Symbols menu.  You can set the "
"angular size, the\n"
"\t\t\tshape, and the color of your new symbols.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>तपाईँ उपकरण मेनु अन्तर्गत एफओभी सम्पादक प्रयोग गरेर, तपाईँको आफ्नो फिल्ड दृश्य "
"(एफओभी) प्रतीक\n"
"\t\t\tनिर्माण गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  तपाईँ आफ्नो नयाँ प्रतीकको कोणिय साइज, आकार, र रङ\n"
"\t\t\tसेट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:368
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Advanced tab of the KStars Configuration window allows you to "
"fine-tune\n"
"\t\t\tthe behavior of KStars. You can specify whether to correct for "
"atmospheric\n"
"\t\t\trefraction, and whether to use animated slewing. You can also specify "
"which\n"
"\t\t\tobjects are hidden while the display is in motion.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>केडीई तारा कन्फिगरेसन सञ्झ्यालको उन्नत ट्याबले केडीई ताराको व्यवहार राम्रो "
"बनाउँन\n"
"\t\t\tअनुमति दिन्छ । तपाईँ वायुमण्डलिय अपर्वतनका लागि \n"
"\t\t\tसुधार गर्ने वा नगर्ने, र एनिमेट गरिएको स्ल्विङ प्रयोग गर्ने वा नगर्ने निर्दिष्ट गर्न "
"सक्नुहुन्छ । तपाईँले प्रदर्शन चालमा हुँदा कुन वस्तु लुकाइएको छ\n"
"\t\t\tभन्ने कुरा पनि निर्दिष्ट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:377
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>KStars displays 126,000 stars, 13,000 deep-sky objects, 88 "
"constellations,\n"
"\t\t\tall planets, the Sun, the Moon, thousands of comets and asteroids, and "
"the\n"
"\t\t\tMilky Way.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>केडीई ताराले १२६,००० ताराहरू, १३,००० गहिरो-आकाशे वस्तु, ८८ तारामण्डल,\n"
"\t\t\tसबै ग्रह, घाम, चन्द्रमा, हजारौ पुच्छ्रेतारा र ग्रहिका र\n"
"\t\t\tमिल्की वे प्रदर्शन गर्दछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:385
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The line in the sky that the Sun and all the Planets seem to follow\n"
"\t\t\tis called the Ecliptic.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>आकाशमा देखिने रेखा जसलाई घाम र सबै ग्रहहरूले पछ्याइरहेको हुन्छ, त्यसलाई\n"
"\t\t\t क्रांतिमण्डल भनिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:392
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>Object positions in KStars include the effects of precession, "
"nutation,\n"
"\t\t\taberration, atmospheric refraction, and light travel time (for "
"planets).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>केडीई तारामा वस्तु स्थितिले (ग्रहका लागि) प्रिसेसन, न्यूटेसन, एबरेसन, वायुमण्डलीय "
"अपवर्तन, प्रकाश हिड्ने समयको प्रभाव\n"
"\t\t\tसमावेश गर्दछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:399
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The nearest star to the Sun is Rigel Kentaurus (alpha Centauri).\n"
"\t\t\tThe brightest star in the sky is Sirius (alpha Canis Majoris).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>घाम देखि सबभन्दा नजिकको तारा रिजेल केन्टाउसर (अल्फा सेन्टाउरी) हो ।\n"
"\t\t\tआकाशमा सबभन्दा चम्किलो तारा सिरिअस (अल्फा क्यानिस मेजोरिस) हो ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:406
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The large group of galaxies between Leo, Virgo and Coma Berenices\n"
"\t\t\tis called the Virgo Cluster of Galaxies.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>लियो, भिर्गो र कोमा बेरिनेसिस बीच ग्यालेक्सीको ठूलो समूहलाई\n"
"\t\t\tग्यालेक्सीको भिर्गो क्लस्टार भनिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:413
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The large group of clusters and nebulae near the south celestial "
"pole\n"
"\t\t\tare objects in the Large Magellanic Cloud, which is a dwarf galaxy in\n"
"\t\t\torbit around the Milky Way.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>दक्षिणी खगोलिय ध्रुव नजिकको क्लस्टर र नेबुलेको ठूलो समूह\n"
"\t\t\tठूलो म्यागेलानिक क्लाउडमा वस्तुहरू हुन्, जुन मिल्की वे वरिपरि अकक्षमा सबभन्दा होचो\n"
"\t\t\tग्यालेक्सी हो ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips:421
msgid ""
"\t\t<p>The Messier Catalog is a list of 110 of the brightest non-stellar "
"objects\n"
"\t\t\tin the sky.  It includes such famous objects as the Orion Nebula (M "
"42), the\n"
"\t\t\tAndromeda Galaxy (M 31), and the Pleiades (M 45).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t<p>अस्तव्यस्त विवरणिका आकाशमा ११० चम्किला तारामय नभएको वस्तुको\n"
"\t\t\tसूची हो ।  यसले अन्य प्रसिद्ध वस्तु पनि समावेश गर्दछ जस्तै ओरियन नेबुला (M 42),\n"
"\t\t\tएन्ड्रोमेडा ग्यालेक्सी (M 31), र प्लियडेस (M 45) ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

